From: MakOS Project <makos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] libunwind: keep MakOS getauxval reference externally visible

MakOS links static PIC libunwind into shared Gecko DSOs.  libunwind builds with
hidden default visibility, but getauxval is supplied by shared musl libc and
must remain a default-visibility undefined reference.

diff --git a/libunwind/src/Registers.hpp b/libunwind/src/Registers.hpp
--- a/libunwind/src/Registers.hpp
+++ b/libunwind/src/Registers.hpp
@@ -23,6 +23,11 @@
 #include <sys/auxv.h>
 #endif
 
+#if defined(__makos__) && defined(_LIBUNWIND_HAVE_GETAUXVAL)
+extern "C" __attribute__((visibility("default"))) unsigned long
+getauxval(unsigned long);
+#endif
+
 namespace libunwind {
 
 // For emulating 128-bit registers
